[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0371","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0371.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-62844","title":"QNAP QHora 弱身份验证漏洞","description":"QNAP QHora 路由器存在弱身份验证漏洞（CWE-1390），攻击者获得本地网络访问权限后，可利用该漏洞绕过身份验证机制，获取设备敏感信息。该漏洞影响 QHora 系列路由器，CVSS 评分 4.0，危害等级中危。厂商已在 QuRouter 2.6.2.007 及后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级固件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-62844"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-20T17:16:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:52:31Z","remediation":"立即将 QNAP QHora 路由器固件升级至 QuRouter 2.6.2.007 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在路由器管理界面关闭不必要的本地管理服务，并在网络层面限制对路由器管理端口的访问（仅允许受信任的管理 IP），同时启用 MAC 地址过滤以降低本地网络攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-26-12","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62844.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62844.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2025-62844.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-62844","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-62844.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-5gfx-m376-wpjr/GHSA-5gfx-m376-wpjr.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2025-62844","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-62844.json","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/5065dafd85905000b1059d7edda6091ac1b72962/Intel%20Reports/thehackernews_com/2026_03_weekly-recap-telecom-sleeper-cells-llm_html/content.txt","https://github.com/gcp-lopo/hacker-news-ai-pages/blob/1e3425b5f1430cdaa222157462695593cb2f609a/archives/2026-03-31/index.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0371.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0557","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0557.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13462","title":"Python CPython tarfile 模块目录类型标准化绕过漏洞","description":"Python 标准库 tarfile 模块在处理 GNU LONGNAME/LONGLINK 多块成员时，错误地将 AREGTYPE (\\x00) 块规范化为 DIRTYPE，导致精心制作的 tar 归档文件被 tarfile 模块解析为目录类型，而其他标准 tar 实现将其解析为普通文件，造成解析不一致。该漏洞影响使用 Python tarfile 模块解析 tar 文件的应用程序，攻击者需在本地控制 tar 文件内容并诱导受害者使用受影响 Python 版本解析，利用解析差异可能绕过路径校验或触发逻辑错误。CVSS 2.0 (LOW)，本地攻击、高攻击复杂度、需低权限、无用户交互，仅造成低完整性影响。Python 官方已在相关版本中修复该规范化逻辑缺陷。","severity":"LOW","score":2.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13462"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-03-12T18:16:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:11Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Python 到 3.11.15、3.12.10 或 3.13.2 及以上版本（含修复补丁 42d754e、72dde10、7ad3093、9a23b75、ae99fe3、d109507）。若暂时无法升级，可临时禁用 tarfile 模块处理 GNU 格式长文件名/长链接的 tar 包，或在解压前使用 tar -tvf 校验归档完整性，禁止解压不可信来源的 tar 归档文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/42d754e34c06e57ad6b8e7f92f32af679912d8ab","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/72dde1016493c52abe857fc4a7bf6c40138b4114","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/7ad3093d76a748af55bdb1d2e8aad3638163b017","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/9a23b753552afa28e3a2f4d8863572fc66479406","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/ae99fe3a33b43e303a05f012815cef60b611a9c7","https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/d10950739a78f54d0718d88fb5a868374603c084","https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/141707","https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/143934","https://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/EOMI5I66ZMKQ2INNFT6T7IAIKUGPZYIE/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13462.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13462.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13462.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13462.json","https://github.com/oracle/solaris-userland/blob/3d93229ea6163b2178f066ea1eb34e30932de820/components/python/python311/patches/33-CVE-2025-13462.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13462.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13462.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-13462","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13462.json","https://github.com/Blazemeter/taurus/blob/7c6c0ad442bfa352a7831263a12fd197098d4799/Dockerfile"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0557.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0354","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0354.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13957","title":"施耐德电气 EcoStruxure Data Center Expert 硬编码凭据远程代码执行漏洞","description":"施耐德电气 EcoStruxure Data Center Expert（原 StruxureWare Data Center Expert）v9.0 及之前版本中存在硬编码凭据漏洞（CWE-798）。当 SOCKS 代理功能启用时，攻击者在已知管理员凭据和 PostgreSQL 数据库凭据的情况下，可通过网络利用该漏洞实现信息泄露和远程代码执行。SOCKS 代理默认处于禁用状态，但一旦开启将带来严重安全风险。该漏洞 CVSS v4.0 评分为 7.5，危害等级较高，可导致敏感数据泄露、系统完整性破坏及关键业务中断。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13957"],"sources":["zdi","cve"],"published":"2026-03-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议用户立即升级 EcoStruxure Data Center Expert 至 SEVD-2026-069-05 安全公告中指定的修复版本。如无需使用 SOCKS 代理功能，应确保其保持默认禁用状态。同时应限制对管理界面的网络访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并定期更换管理员及数据库凭据。具体补丁文件请从施耐德电气官网下载中心获取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://download.schneider-electric.com/files?p_Doc_Ref=SEVD-2026-069-05&p_enDocType=Security+and+Safety+Notice&p_File_Name=SEVD-2026-069-05.pdf","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-13957","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13957.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-65x8-8358-vgrj/GHSA-65x8-8358-vgrj.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0354.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0477","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0477.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11563","title":"curl wcurl 路径遍历漏洞","description":"wcurl 工具存在路径遍历漏洞，当 URL 中包含百分号编码的斜杠（`/` 或 `\\`）时，攻击者可诱使用户下载特制 URL，导致输出文件被保存到当前目录之外的非预期位置。该漏洞仅影响 wcurl 命令行工具，攻击者需诱骗用户访问恶意 URL 方可利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至修复版本以消除此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11563"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-02-25T08:16:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:30:42Z","remediation":"升级 curl 至 8.18.0 及以上版本（wcurl 2025.11.09 已修复此漏洞）。如无法立即升级，使用 wcurl 时添加 `--no-decode-filename` 参数禁用百分号解码，或始终通过 `-o` 显式指定输出文件名，避免路径遍历风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-11563.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-11563.json","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/11/04/1","https://lists.debian.org/debian-release/2025/11/msg00504.html","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/f1474030af3857f11221367c2b4c5e819443b201/docs/CVE-2025-11563.md","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/f1474030af3857f11221367c2b4c5e819443b201/docs/CVE-2025-11563.json.in","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11563.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e416a76e395c31381fb5ba3eaf056e80b234a82c/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11563.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11563.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11563.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11563.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/91f933d7141464d1f110020643e01c0b63c276fb/data/2025/CVE-2025-11563.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11563.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11563.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0477.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0477.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0606","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-15281","title":"GNU glibc wordexp 未初始化内存漏洞","description":"GNU C 标准库（glibc）版本 2.0 至 2.42 中的 wordexp 函数存在未初始化内存访问漏洞。当应用程序同时使用 WRDE_REUSE 和 WRDE_APPEND 标志调用 wordexp 时，内部内存分配机制未能正确初始化返回的 we_wordv 数组，导致该数组包含未初始化的内存值。随后调用 wordfree 释放内存时，可能触发进程异常中止。该漏洞影响广泛部署于 Linux 发行版及类 Unix 系统的核心标准库，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危）。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，攻击复杂度低，主要造成可用性影响（进程崩溃），具体利用方式取决于应用层对 wordexp 的调用场景（如 Shell 风格单词展开、环境变量解析等文本处理功能）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-15281"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-20T14:16:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:37:31Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 到 2.43 或更高版本以获取完整修复。立即重新构建并部署所有容器和系统。临时缓解措施是禁用对 wordexp 函数的调用，或使用编译时选项 -D_XOPEN_SOURCE=700 以禁用 WRDE_REUSE 和 WRDE_APPEND 标志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=33814","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/20/3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15281.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c3b619fb02eed1c084cf7dca0b26d6106b797434/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15281.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-15281.json","https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/164bafa5ce4a1142d29977462b80e371d4fac118/Formula/g/glibc.rb","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-15281.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-15281.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-15281.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-15281.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-152xx/CVE-2025-15281.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-15281.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0360","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0360.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14237","title":"Canon 多款激光打印机 XPS字体解析缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"佳能多款小型办公多功能打印机和激光打印机（包括 Satera LBP670C/MF750C 系列、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C 系列、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C 系列、imageRUNNER 1643i II 等，固件版本 v06.02 及更早）的 XPS 字体解析处理模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-787）。该漏洞源于程序在处理特制 XPS 文件中的 TTF 字体数据时未正确校验长度，导致整数溢出进而引发越界写入。在 Pwn2Own 黑客大赛中已证实可被利用，网络相邻且未经验证的攻击者可通过向目标打印机发送特制的 XPS 打印任务触发该漏洞，导致设备拒绝服务或执行任意代码。CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14237"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-16T00:16:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:35Z","remediation":"立即将受影响 Canon 打印机固件升级至 v06.02 之后的最新版本。固件更新包可通过 Canon 官方支持网站（https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/）获取对应型号的更新文件，在打印机 Web 管理界面中通过\"固件更新\"功能上传安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络层面限制打印机仅接受来自受信任管理网段的访问，在防火墙上阻断非必要的 9100/TCP（Raw IPP）、515/TCP（LPD）及 80/TCP（Web 管理）端口的入站流量，并将打印机部署在独立 VLAN 中与业务网络隔离。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response","https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/","https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/","https://www.usa.canon.com/support/canon-product-advisories/Service-Notice-Regarding-Remediation-Measure-Against-Potential-Buffer-Overflow-Vulnerability-in-Laser-Printers-and-Small-Office-Multifunctional-Printers","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14237.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14237.json","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/4698ebfa007afa227014ebd67288e1c89d760caa/app/routes/posts/2026-01-16_CVE-2025-14237.mdx","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-14237.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-j8v7-fcfg-6gwq/GHSA-j8v7-fcfg-6gwq.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14237.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-01-17_en.md","https://github.com/mrhenrike/EmbedXPL-Forge/blob/55da15272f066aa9d0dde3f336f7d474e1f45ac1/nse/embedxpl-printer-vuln.nse","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-01-17_09-27-13.md","https://github.com/mrhenrike/PrinterXPL-Forge/blob/14c2b448afe36924e033ea4d211b90a81e1b3f30/xpl/research/research-canon-xps-bof-2025b/exploit.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0360.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0360.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0360.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0359","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0359.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14236","title":"Canon imageCLASS MF654Cdw 打印机地址簿属性标签处理栈缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"佳能 imageCLASS MF654Cdw 等多款小型办公多功能打印机的通讯录属性标签处理功能中存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理特制的 Address Book 属性标签数据时未正确验证输入长度，导致栈缓冲区溢出。在 Pwn2Own 大赛中已证实，网络相邻的未经认证攻击者可通过向受影响打印机发送特制数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标设备上以设备权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响佳能多款打印机系列，包括 Satera LBP670C、Satera MF750C、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C 等型号的 v06.02 及更早版本固件，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14236"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-16T00:16:28Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:35Z","remediation":"立即将受影响设备（Canon imageCLASS MF654Cdw 及 Satera LBP670C/MF750C、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C 系列、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C 系列等）固件升级至 v06.02 之后的最新版本。请访问 Canon 官方支持网站（https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/）下载对应型号的最新固件。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制打印机仅接受受信任管理主机的访问，并在防火墙中隔离打印机子网，禁止非授权设备直接通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response","https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/","https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/","https://www.usa.canon.com/support/canon-product-advisories/Service-Notice-Regarding-Remediation-Measure-Against-Potential-Buffer-Overflow-Vulnerability-in-Laser-Printers-and-Small-Office-Multifunctional-Printers","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14236.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14236.json","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/4698ebfa007afa227014ebd67288e1c89d760caa/app/routes/posts/2026-01-16_CVE-2025-14236.mdx","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-14236.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-429r-fcw9-gj73/GHSA-429r-fcw9-gj73.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14236.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-01-17_en.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-01-17_09-27-13.md","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2026/01/2026-01-16-report.json","https://github.com/Vulnogram/Vulnogram.github.io/blob/03d1f7c2ed28d3f17bbbd1f667dea86eb0f34dfa/rss/canon.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0359.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0358","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0358.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14235","title":"佳能 imageCLASS 等多款打印机 TTF 解析越界写入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"佳能激光打印机和小型办公多功能一体机在处理 XPS 字体 fpgm 数据时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-787），该漏洞源于对特制 XPS 文档中字体程序（fpgm）数据长度校验不充分，导致越界写入。网络相邻的攻击者无需身份认证即可向受影响设备发送特制的打印作业或 XPS 文件触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致设备拒绝服务或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响佳能日本、美国、欧洲市场多个系列打印机固件 v06.02 及更早版本，CVSS 4.0 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。该漏洞在 Pwn2Own 大赛中被公开披露，厂商已发布安全公告 CP2026-001 并提供固件更新修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14235"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-16T00:16:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:35Z","remediation":"立即将受影响设备（Satera LBP670C/MF750C系列、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C系列、imageCLASS LBP230系列/MF450系列、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C系列等）的固件升级至 v06.02 之后的版本。请访问 https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/ 或 https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response 下载对应型号的最新固件。在无法立即升级的情况下，建议在网络层面限制打印机仅对受信任的管理端开放打印服务端口，并将打印机部署在独立 VLAN 中，避免与不受信网络直接连通。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response","https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/","https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/","https://www.usa.canon.com/support/canon-product-advisories/Service-Notice-Regarding-Remediation-Measure-Against-Potential-Buffer-Overflow-Vulnerability-in-Laser-Printers-and-Small-Office-Multifunctional-Printers","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14235.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14235.json","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/4698ebfa007afa227014ebd67288e1c89d760caa/app/routes/posts/2026-01-16_CVE-2025-14235.mdx","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-14235.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-wcv5-68f6-32pr/GHSA-wcv5-68f6-32pr.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14235.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-01-17_en.md","https://github.com/mrhenrike/PrinterXPL-Forge/blob/14c2b448afe36924e033ea4d211b90a81e1b3f30/xpl/research/research-canon-pcl-bof/exploit.py","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/1959df386fdebd740db724e4a35bc2cfa0cd1598/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2026/canon/gb_canon_printers_CP2026-001_1.nasl","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-01-18_09-28-16.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0358.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0357","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14234","title":"佳能 imageCLASS MF654Cdw 打印机 PJCC 请求解析堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"佳能 imageCLASS MF654Cdw 等多款小型办公多功能打印机与激光打印机的 PJCC 请求解析组件存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于对 CPCA 列表处理时边界检查不足，网络相邻且未经验证的攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 PJCC 数据包触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行或设备无响应。受影响机型包括佳能 Satera LBP670C/MF750C、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C 等多系列产品固件 v06.02 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14234"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-16T00:16:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:35Z","remediation":"立即将受影响 Canon 打印机/多功能一体机固件升级至 v06.03 或更高版本。具体型号包括：Satera LBP670C/MF750C 系列、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C 系列、imageCLASS LBP230/MF450 系列、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C 系列等（完整列表见 Canon 安全公告 CP2026-001）。如无法立即升级，可在网络防火墙或交换机 ACL 中限制对打印机 TCP 端口 9013（CADM 服务）的访问，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response","https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/","https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/","https://www.usa.canon.com/support/canon-product-advisories/Service-Notice-Regarding-Remediation-Measure-Against-Potential-Buffer-Overflow-Vulnerability-in-Laser-Printers-and-Small-Office-Multifunctional-Printers","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14234.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14234.json","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/9af3dcd2665eeef037166cc1ef8ef57112eebb3a/app/routes/posts/2026-01-16_CVE-2025-14234.mdx","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-14234.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-jh9g-9h7m-5j4j/GHSA-jh9g-9h7m-5j4j.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14234.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/67b5579a0905226d1df11dd602ae7fa1e4ed04d3/CVEs_log/2026-01-17_en.md","https://github.com/mrhenrike/PrinterXPL-Forge/blob/14c2b448afe36924e033ea4d211b90a81e1b3f30/xpl/research/research-canon-xps-bof-2025b/exploit.py","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/87dd30aa48db35ba8d8b4a33772213f42a64ff82/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-01-17_09-27-13.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/f9f61f0882f53057e94aea140828cc5fcfb545d0/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-205.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0357.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0356","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0356.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14233","title":"佳能 多款激光打印机与多功能一体机 CPCA 文件删除处理无效释放漏洞","description":"佳能（Canon）多款小型办公多功能打印机和激光打印机在处理 CPCA 文件删除时存在无效释放（Invalid Free）漏洞（CWE-763）。同一网段的攻击者可通过发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致打印机服务无响应或执行任意代码。受影响机型包括 Satera LBP670C/MF750C 系列、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C 系列、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C 系列及 imageRUNNER 1643i 系列等，固件版本 v06.02 及更早版本均受影响。CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14233"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-16T00:16:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:34Z","remediation":"立即将受影响佳能打印机/复合机固件升级至 v06.02 之后的最新版本，可通过 Canon 官方支持网站下载对应型号的固件更新包。同时，切勿将设备直接暴露在公网，应将其部署在防火墙或路由器后的私有网络环境中，使用私有 IP 地址，并禁用不必要的网络服务（如 BJNP 服务）以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response","https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/","https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/","https://www.usa.canon.com/support/canon-product-advisories/Service-Notice-Regarding-Remediation-Measure-Against-Potential-Buffer-Overflow-Vulnerability-in-Laser-Printers-and-Small-Office-Multifunctional-Printers","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14233.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14233.json","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/9af3dcd2665eeef037166cc1ef8ef57112eebb3a/app/routes/posts/2026-01-16_CVE-2025-14233.mdx","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-14233.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-8cgh-48g2-rj4j/GHSA-8cgh-48g2-rj4j.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14233.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/67b5579a0905226d1df11dd602ae7fa1e4ed04d3/CVEs_log/2026-01-17_zh.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/87dd30aa48db35ba8d8b4a33772213f42a64ff82/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-01-17_09-27-13.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/f9f61f0882f53057e94aea140828cc5fcfb545d0/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-222.json","https://github.com/Vulnogram/Vulnogram.github.io/blob/825cd86dcf0ac6c556603440698843689087870d/rss/canon.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0356.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0355","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14232","title":"Canon 激光打印机 XPS解析器栈缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"佳能多款激光打印机和小型办公多功能一体机 XPS 解析组件存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-787）。攻击者无需身份认证，通过向受影响设备发送特制的 XPS 文件即可触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致设备无响应或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响佳能 Satera LBP670C、MF750C、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C 及 imageRUNNER 1643i II 等系列固件 v06.02 及更早版本，在 Pwn2Own 大赛中被公开演示，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。厂商已发布固件更新修复该漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14232"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-16T00:16:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:34Z","remediation":"立即将 Canon 激光打印机/小型多功能一体机的固件升级至 v06.02 之后的最新版本，通过 Canon 官网对应机型的固件下载页面获取更新。同时，务必配置防火墙或路由器，确保打印机仅位于私有网络内并使用私有 IP 地址，禁止将打印机直接暴露在互联网上。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response","https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/","https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/","https://www.usa.canon.com/support/canon-product-advisories/Service-Notice-Regarding-Remediation-Measure-Against-Potential-Buffer-Overflow-Vulnerability-in-Laser-Printers-and-Small-Office-Multifunctional-Printers","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14232.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14232.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-14232.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-mqv7-mfm2-rp2p/GHSA-mqv7-mfm2-rp2p.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14232.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/67b5579a0905226d1df11dd602ae7fa1e4ed04d3/CVEs_log/2026-01-17_zh.md","https://github.com/mrhenrike/PrinterXPL-Forge/blob/14c2b448afe36924e033ea4d211b90a81e1b3f30/xpl/research/research-canon-ps-bof/exploit.py","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2026/canon/gb_canon_printers_CP2026-001_1.nasl","https://github.com/mrhenrike/EmbedXPL-Forge/blob/55da15272f066aa9d0dde3f336f7d474e1f45ac1/embedxpl/modules/exploits/printers/canon/canon_ps_bof_cve_2025_14232.py","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/f9f61f0882f53057e94aea140828cc5fcfb545d0/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-204.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0355.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0375","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0375.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-71066","title":"Linux 内核 net/sched ETS 调度器竞争条件释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 net/sched 子系统的 ETS（Enhanced Transmission Selection）调度器存在条件竞争漏洞。`ets_qdisc_change` 函数在释放旧 class 的 Qdisc 对象后未及时将其从活跃链表中移除，导致 `ets_qdisc_dequeue` 可并发访问已释放的 `struct Qdisc` 对象，触发 Use-After-Free。本地攻击者需具备创建用户和网络命名空间的权限，通过并发触发 `tc qdisc change` 与数据包收发操作之间的竞争窗口，可实现权限提升或内核代码执行。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各发行版版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-71066"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-13T16:16:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:03:35Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含提交 0a8c5f1e2b3c（\"net/sched: ets: Always remove class from active list before deleting in ets_qdisc_change\"）的版本，该修复已合入主线内核 6.13 及以上版本。各发行版用户：Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-1109-azure-fips 5.15.0-1109.118+fips1 或安装 USN-8163-1 对应更新；SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP7 安装 SUSE-SU-2026:0587-1 更新。如无法立即升级内核，可通过限制用户创建新的网络命名空间权限（移除 `cap_net_admin` 能力或使用 seccomp 过滤 `unshare(CLONE_NEWNET)`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/062d5d544e564473450d72e6af83077c2b2ff7c3","https://git.ker