CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-15504.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-15504.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-15504.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-155xx/CVE-2025-15504.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0611.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0605","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0605.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-15224","title":"curl libssh 密钥短语绕过漏洞","description":"curl 在使用 libssh 进行基于 SSH 的 SCP 或 SFTP 传输时，当请求进行公钥认证时，会错误地仍然尝试使用本地运行的 SSH agent 进行询问和认证，即使未设置 agent 也会发生此行为。该漏洞属于不当认证（CWE-287），攻击者可利用此缺陷在特定条件下绕过认证机制。影响使用 libssh 作为 SSH 后端的 curl 版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 3.1（LOW），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度高（AC:H），无需权限（PR:N），需要用户交互（UI:R），范围未改变（S:U），仅对完整性造成低影响（I:L），无机密性和可用性影响。攻击前提是目标系统正在使用 curl 进行基于 libssh 的 SSH 传输且启用了公钥认证，攻击者需诱导用户发起受影响的传输操作。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-15224"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-08T10:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:37:24Z","remediation":"建议立即升级curl到支持补丁的最新版本（curl 8.10.0或更高版本），或直接应用现有的dhi-cve-2025-15224-libssh-publickey-auth补丁至curl代码库，并在SSH客户端配置中禁用对SSH代理的自动信任，强制要求手动指定密钥文件路径和密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-15224.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-15224.json","https://hackerone.com/reports/3480925","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/07/7","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/87c7d8544e9119b01e84366bbb294f2a2864329a/docs/CVE-2025-15224.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15224.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/67e4f2259ee77a0081a521c1e645484964f36ab6/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-15224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-15224.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-15224.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-15224.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-15224.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-15224.json","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/catalog/blob/bec48701643cdacef8e31ac9258db483425a897c/package/deb/main/curl/patch/dhi-cve-2025-15224-libssh-publickey-auth.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0605.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0604","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0604.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-15079","title":"curl libssh 全局 known_hosts 绕过漏洞","description":"tags.<value>libcurl 在进行基于 SSH 的 SCP 或 SFTP 文件传输时，若应用程序指定了 known_hosts 文件进行主机验证，libcurl 仍可能错误地接受连接不在该指定文件中的主机——前提是这些主机已被添加到 libssh 的全局 known_hosts 文件中。该漏洞存在于使用 libssh 后端（而非 libssh2）构建的 libcurl 版本中，根本原因在于 libssh 的 API 会在未找到指定主机时自动回退到内置的全局 known_hosts 文件进行验证。攻击者需满足高交互攻击条件，在用户发起 SSH 传输操作且全局 known_hosts 文件被攻击者预先污染的情况下，可实现对主机的欺骗性连接，从而绕过主机身份验证机制，存在中间人攻击风险。curl 官方已在 8.18.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-15079"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-01-08T10:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:37:03Z","remediation":"建议立即将 curl 升级至 8.18.0 或更高版本，curl 8.18.0 修复了 libssh 后端在 SSH 文件传输时未正确验证 known_hosts 文件的问题。如无法立即升级，可将 curl 编译配置切换为使用 libssh2 后端替代 libssh 后端，或暂时避免使用 SCP 和 SFTP 协议。受影响版本为 curl 7.58.0 至 8.17.0，curl 8.18.0 已引入修复 commit adca486c125d9a6d9565b9607a19dce803。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-15079.html","https://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-15079.json","https://hackerone.com/reports/3477116","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/07/6","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/87c7d8544e9119b01e84366bbb294f2a2864329a/docs/CVE-2025-15079.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15079.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/67e4f2259ee77a0081a521c1e645484964f36ab6/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15079.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-15079.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-15079.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-15079.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-15079.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-15079.json","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/catalog/blob/bec48701643cdacef8e31ac9258db483425a897c/package/deb/main/curl/patch/dhi-cve-2025-15079-libssh-knownhosts.patch","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-15079.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0604.toml"}]